Lists configured Gmail accounts (name/email/scope/default only — no secrets, no network)

Usage: gwi gmail account list [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --account <NAME>
          Selects a named Gmail account configured in `~/.gwi/settings.json` (AWS-CLI style, mirrors the top-level `--profile`) for this invocation.
          
